  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges and place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 25-30 mins.\n• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm slices. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6466b09eca7683c2c40367bd/step-f77eb6ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse lentils. Grate carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, mash lentils and the egg until lentils are broken up.\n• Stir in carrot, the plain flour, fine breadcrumbs, vegetable stock, spicy taco seasoning (add less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Using damp hands, roll mixture into small balls, (you should get 4 per person) then flatten into 1cm-thick patties.\n• Place on a plate and transfer to fridge for 5 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6466b09eca7683c2c40367bd/step-c64af876.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the wedges have 10 mins remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook patties until golden, 2-4 mins each side. Transfer to plate lined with paper towel.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Wipe out the frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6466b09eca7683c2c40367bd/step-a663d9e0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Cut lemon into wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Add tomato and mixed salad leaves. Season and toss to coat.\n• Divide patties, haloumi, fries and salad between plates.\n• Serve with garlic aioli and lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6466b09eca7683c2c40367bd/step-2e8cbbd7.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
